# Volkswagen Polo Mk2 (Typ 86C) three-door hatchback, 1981-1994.
#
# The Polo II, the hatchback version of the Audi 50: 3,655 mm long, 1,570 mm
# wide, 1,350 mm high, 2,335 mm wheelbase; 1.0-1.3 petrol and a 1.4 diesel.
# Facelift in 1990. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Polo
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Green are documented Volkswagen colours of the
# period.
#
# Weight: 140 in total (white 45, red 35, blue 35, green 25).
#
# Speed 155 km/h; comfort 70/285 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1981-1994 with a road tail to about 2004.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-polo-mk2.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-polo-mk2/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
name=VWPoloMk2(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=45
intro_year=1981
intro_month=10
retire_year=2004
retire_month=6
speed=155
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=70
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=285

